# A creature put onto the battlefield attacking a player who is no longer in the game enters, but is never an attacking
# creature (CR 508.4a, 506.3c, 800.4a). In a three-player game Bot3's library holds one card past its opening hand, which
# it draws on turn 3. On turn 4 Bot1's Ornithopter attacks Bot3, unblocked, and Bot1 casts Leonardo for his sneak cost {W},
# returning the Ornithopter; with Leonardo on the stack Bot1 casts Ancestral Recall on Bot3, who draws from an empty library
# and loses (CR 704.5b). Leonardo resolves tapped and not attacking: he deals no combat damage, so Bot1 gains no life and
# he gets no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Ornithopter
Leonardo, Cutting Edge
Ancestral Recall
Island
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest x8

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot3)
[T4 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Hand.Leonardo, Cutting Edge.Cast(Ability: Sneak)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot3)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
? Bot3.Status = Lost
? Stack = Leonardo, Cutting Edge
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Combat.Attackers.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Leonardo, Cutting Edge.Tapped = true
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot3.Status = Lost
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Island; Leonardo, Cutting Edge
Bot1.Battlefield.Leonardo, Cutting Edge.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
